sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant API
  participant Registry as Interrupt registry
  participant Runtime as LangGraph runtime
  Runtime->>Registry: persist interrupt + checkpoint + roles
  User->>API: decision + version + idempotency
  API->>Registry: tenant/RBAC/freshness claim
  Registry-->>API: one winning claim
  API->>Runtime: Command(resume) on exact thread
  Runtime-->>Registry: checkpoint and terminal resolution
  API-->>User: sanitized updated status
